]\nUI.FW.a11y-tree\tSemantic accessibility tree for game UI\tui-architect\tE\t['accessibility']\nUI.FW.logic\tUI logic hosting via reflection-invoked handlers (script/visual script)\tui-architect\tE\t['scripting-runtime']\nUI.FW.loading-screens\tNon-blocking loading/boot screens & movie playback\tui-architect\tE\t['resource-streaming-architect', 'media-playback']\nUI.FW.subtitles\tSubtitle & caption presentation\tui-architect\tE\t['accessibility']\nED.ARCH.process\tEditor process architecture (in-process vs out-of-process runtime)\teditor-architect\tE\nED.ARCH.separation\tEditor ↔ runtime data separation\teditor-architect\tE\nED.ARCH.selection\tSelection model\teditor-architect\tE\nED.ARCH.extension\tEditor extension API & tool scripting (Python class)\teditor-architect\tE\t['plugin-system']\nED.ARCH.pie\tPlay-in-editor & simulation isolation\teditor-architect\tE\t['world-editor-viewport']\nED.ARCH.remote\tRemote / on-device live editing\teditor-architect\tE\nED.ARCH.headless\tHeadless editor & commandlets\teditor-architect\tE\t['ci-cd-automation']\nED.ARCH.scale\tEditor performance for large projects\teditor-architect\tE\nED.ARCH.recovery\tAutosave, transaction journal & crash recovery\teditor-architect\tE\t['crash-diagnostics']\nED.ARCH.pie-net\tMultiplayer play-in-editor & network emulation\teditor-architect\tE\t['dedicated-server', 'network-transport']\nED.ARCH.agent-api\tAgent/automation control & introspection protocol for editor and runtime\teditor-architect\tM\t['visual-debugging-tools', 'observability-telemetry']\nED.ARCH.discipline-workflows\tPer-discipline end-to-end workflow specs & iteration targets\teditor-architect\tE\t['hot-reload-iteration']","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"c479ccb4-0c49-4d15-9672-11c1a03fcee0","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:21:36.908Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cdecb7f4-3ba2-43c9-b8b0-d8f241a01211","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1