class'),c,m.get(c))\n\"","description":"Compare radar class vs capability maturity"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfY3LvkJEYjzqRWdvZfJU","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"e6e1f97c-bd22-459c-8a1b-5ed10eb656dd","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:39.861Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
{"parentUuid":"e6e1f97c-bd22-459c-8a1b-5ed10eb656dd","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"9bdfc07b-8ff1-4e95-9c88-de7440fd6192","agentId":"aea371135e52bab86","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018PzWtdtjnq6jXmDwjH7xQm","type":"tool_result","content":"Cloud game streaming targets M PLAT.PAL.cloud-streaming M\n\nCloud-hybrid compute (split client/cloud simulation) X PLAT.PAL.cloud-hybrid X\n\nECS relationships M CORE.ECS.relationships M\n\nC++26 static reflection M CORE.REFL.generation M\n\nOpenUSD as interchange backbone M CNT.IMP.usd M\n\nMaterialX / OpenPBR interchange & model M RND.MAT.openpbr M\n\nPlanetary & geospatial worlds M WLD.ENV.terrain-planetary M\n\nPlanetary & geospatial worlds M CNT.IMP.geospatial M\n\nML-generated content in PCG X WLD.PCG.ml X\n\nWork graphs & mesh nodes X RND.GRAPH.work-graphs E\n\nCluster/virtualized geometry refinements (deforming LOD, displacement) M RND.LOD.displacement M\n\nACES 2.0 output transforms M RND.POST.aces2 M\n\nSlang shading language M RND.SHADER.slang M\n\nIn-shader neural evaluation & differentiable shaders M RND.SHADER.autodiff M\n\nWebGPU backend & web 3D M RND.RHI.webgpu M\n\nGaussian splatting & radiance fields X RND.GEO.splat-relight X\n\nGaussian splatting & radiance fields X CNT.IMP.splats X\n\nML runtime (inference, packaging, scheduling, NPU) M ML.RT.inference M\n\nML runtime (inference, packaging, scheduling, NPU) M ML.RT.packaging M\n\nML runtime (inference, packaging, scheduling, NPU) M ML.RT.training-boundary M\n\nGPU physics offload M PHY.ARCH.gpu M\n\nSDF collision M PHY.COL.sdf M\n\nParticle & GPU fluids M PHY.FLUID.particles M\n\nParticle & GPU fluids M PHY.FLUID.gpu M\n\nML cloth & learned deformables X PHY.SOFT.ml X\n\nWave-based acoustic propagation M AUD.SPAT.propagation M\n\nSeamless server meshing X NET.ARCH.meshing X\n\nQUIC/WebTransport game transport M NET.TRANS.quic M\n\nLearned & LLM-driven agents M GAM.AI.learned M\n\nLearned & LLM-driven agents M GAM.AI.llm M\n\nGenerative authoring tools M ED.AI.generative M\n\nGenerative authoring tools M ED.AI.evaluation M\n\nAgent/automation control API (MCP class) M QA.FUNC.agent-exploration M\n\nGenerative-AI service boundary & guardrails M PLAT.SVC.genai-boundary M\n\nAutostereo / light-field displays M RND.ARCH.multiview E","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"34fe82e2-4ec0-4fd2-873f-d0aedc7217e3","timestamp":"2026-09-29T16:24:39.942Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e6e1f97c-bd22-459c-8a1b-5ed10eb656dd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.284","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
